OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 25 FEB
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe Philharmonia is joined by
OL,6,     GVikingur Olafsson to perform John
OL,7,     GAdams's new Piano Concerto,
OL,8,     Gbefore taking centre stage with
OL,9,     GRavel's complete ballet score
OL,10,     GDaphnis and Chloe.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,12,     FStreet - series 2
OL,13,     GDr Rommi Smith examines the music
OL,14,     Gand contributions of five leading
OL,15,     GBlack female musicians to civil
OL,16,     Grights and social change.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
